{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "1f67c7f3-8772-8b07-b1e0-f580d2342630",
  "created_at": "2026-03-03T13:33:03-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Donna Grasso",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:27:53-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:27:57-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Denise. My name is Donna Grasso. I'm calling about a storm drain in front of a house I own, three sixty-five Harrison Avenue, the Fort Adams side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:28:15-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, three sixty-five Harrison. What's it doing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:28:20-05:00",
      "duration": 31,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's slow. It kind of grunts, you know, gurgles, and then the water just sits there and backs up into the street. It does it any time we get a thaw. And there's no storm. It's dry out. It's just the melting, and then it's a puddle across the whole lane."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:28:51-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So not coming off a storm, just regular melt and it won't drain."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:29:00-05:00",
      "duration": 24,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. Even a couple of days of nice weather and it backs up. And the traffic slows to a crawl going through it. People creep through so they don't splash, and then you've got a line of cars."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:29:24-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that'll back things up. Is the water getting onto the property or just the road?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:29:35-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just the road right now. It gets up to the edge of the yard but not in. I'm the landlord, so I'm not there all day, my tenant told me about it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:29:55-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Let me make sure I have the spot right. Is it right in front of the house, at the curb?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:30:09-05:00",
      "duration": 24,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, right at the curb in front. If you're coming from the fort, it's past where the bank used to be, you go a little ways and it's on your left, I think. Three sixty-five is on the mailbox."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:30:33-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, I've got the number. I'll put it in as a drainage complaint, a slow or blocked catch basin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:30:46-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Can I ask, do the crews work weekends? Because the thaw is supposed to hit Saturday and Sunday, I think."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:31:00-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mostly they're out weekdays on regular work orders. Weekend is usually for emergencies. So I'd say this gets looked at in the week, probably sooner than later since it's affecting traffic."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:31:20-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that's fine. Sorry, hold on, the clock in the hallway is chiming, let me move. Okay, I'm back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:31:32-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Does the water clear eventually, or does it stay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:31:40-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It clears, but slowly. By evening it's mostly gone, then the next day it starts again if it's warm."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:31:52-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That sounds like it's partly clogged. Debris, maybe sand from the winter. I'll note that it happens daily on warm days so the crew knows what to look for."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:32:10-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Do you need a phone number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:32:15-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, give me a callback number in case I need to reach you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:32:24-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's four oh one, five five five, oh one seven one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:32:32-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, oh one seven one. Got it. And it's Donna Grasso, G-R-A-S-S-O?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:32:43-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right, two S's."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:32:46-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. You're all set. It's in the system and the crew will get to it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:32:56-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. Thanks, Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T13:32:59-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Donna. Take care."
    }
  ],
